# The six machines of a run. Copy to hosts.env and fill in.
# BP: the brokers' public addresses, the one that should lead first. BV: the same brokers' addresses on the
# private network (the brokers listen there only). LP: the loaders' public addresses.
# Measure every machine's disk first (scripts/fsync.py): on 2026-10-12 six droplets of one size were ten times
# apart, and the brokers must be the ones that sync fast.
BP=(203.0.113.11 203.0.113.12 203.0.113.13)
BV=(10.0.0.11 10.0.0.12 10.0.0.13)
LP=(203.0.113.21 203.0.113.22 203.0.113.23)
